# Bank Transaction Log - Complete Prose Program
# Demonstrates dictionaries, entities, mutation, whenever blocks,
# dynamic substitution, and goto loops.

A Dictionary named risk-registry exists.
Inside risk-registry, "Overdraft" maps to "HIGH RISK".
Inside risk-registry, "Standard" maps to "LOW RISK".

A Account named primary exists.
primary's balance is 500.
primary's owner is "Bob".

A Text named warning-log exists as follows until EndLog:
    =========================================
    CRITICAL: Account values dropped below 0.
    Investigation mandatory.
    =========================================
EndLog

Label "Transaction Start".
Print "Initializing daily financial verification processing."

Whenever primary's balance changes
    If primary's balance is less than 0
        Print warning-log.
        Print "Status evaluation: " followed by (the value for "Overdraft" inside risk-registry).
        Jump to the label "Transaction Start".

# Triggering an adjustment - this will trigger the Whenever block
Lower primary's balance by 600.
